      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm also having this problem. My mic will work fine whenever I go to different worlds, but it cuts out after a few minutes. If I leave the world and come back, it will start to work again, but only for a certain amount of time. It's gotten so bad to the point where I've simply resorted talking to friends in Discord chats, but it's annoying whenever someone who I don't have in my server tries talking to me, and I can't respond to them in game. Has anyone found a solution to this problem? I've been dealing with this for quite some time now, and haven't found a solution yet.",
