      "value": "@{5b450c049d76cd5de243abfd|full_name}: so our microphones did not turn back on when we changed worlds. The issue we had seems to have something to do with a bug in windows that changes the system clock. That bug can get worked around by disabling hibernation and sleep functionality with a console command. Though I am to this date still not 100% sure that it has to do with the system clock not working properly.\nI would suggest deactivating sleep/hibernation like shown here: https://www.geeksinphoenix.com/blog/post/2011/07/28/Disable-Windows-hibernation-and-free-up-disk-space.aspx",
      "viewerReactions": null
